[00:47.92] There’s nothing new to say or do
[00:52.53] There’s nothing new to crave
[00:57.16] Tell the doctors I’m done
[00:59.33] The kids, “Adieu”
[01:01.60] And Mother, “Désolé”
[01:08.72] One last goodbye and one last kiss
[01:18.12] One last dance with the Goddess Nyx

[01:26.09] No feeling
[01:28.28] No pain
[01:32.29] No one to blame
[01:36.80] Forever awaits
[01:41.48] It’s just an eternal blank page

[02:09.36] Some bones stand on their own
[02:13.56] Some bones are carried
[02:18.44] Mine are either, neither, or both -
[02:22.72] They just ache to be buried

[02:28.61] Help me dig a hole!
[02:32.64] I’m already cold!
[02:37.50] (I honestly never planned on getting old…)

[02:47.00] I know you’re waiting for some sign of life 
[02:54.77] but the pain is too much to endure
[02:59.77] Goodnight…

[03:38.51] One last goodbye and one last wish
[03:46.80] One last slow dance with the Goddess Nyx

[03:56.01] No feeling
[03:58.15] No pain
[04:02.24] No one’s to blame
[04:06.72] Forever awaits
[04:11.55] It’s just an eternal blank page
[04:19.55] 